<step1>
<ptxt>Multi-information Display</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Multi-information Display Flowchart</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162390J01" width="7.106578999in" height="9.803535572in"/>
</figure>
<step3>
<ptxt>*1: Press the "DISP" switch to cycle through the drive displays in order. (Including warning displays inserted by interruption.) However, "DISP" switch input is disabled while the [opening screen] is displayed.</ptxt>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>*2: Pressing and holding the "DISP" switch for 0.8 seconds or more resets the displayed value.</ptxt>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>*3: Pressing and holding the "DISP" switch for 1 seconds or more switches to the setting screen.</ptxt>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>When a new warning occurs or the display state changes, it is displayed immediately by interruption. The warning screen is inserted at the position immediately before the interruption. Even while a warning screen is displayed, the "DISP" switch can be used to switch the display to other modes. When the warning is cleared, the warning screen is deleted and the next display in order is shown.</ptxt>
</step3>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Warning Display</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162403" width="7.106578999in" height="8.799559038in"/>
</figure>
<step3>
<ptxt>Warnings are scrolled automatically.</ptxt>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>When warnings occur, they are displayed in order from the lowest display priority level number.</ptxt>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>When multiple warnings occur, each warning is displayed at 2-second intervals. However, a newly occurring warning is displayed for 6 seconds the first time only.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Warning items marked "initial display 2S" in the remarks are displayed for 2 seconds even when displayed for the first time.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</step3>
<step3>
<ptxt>"Depress brake when starting" is not displayed on the meter with IG ON because the transmitting ECU cannot send it with IG ON.</ptxt>
</step3>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Warning Display List by System</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162391" width="7.106578999in" height="8.799559038in"/>
</figure>
</step2>
</step1>
